# All Good Things...: I, II and III each "draw two cards, then exile a card from your hand" and IV "if all cards exiled
# with this Saga share a card type, you gain 10 life" (CR 607.2a, 714). Chapter I exiles Ornithopter, a card it has just
# drawn (the draw comes first, CR 608.2c); it is an artifact creature, the others plain artifacts, so they share only
# artifact, which one type on every card is enough for. Bot2's Lightning Bolt in hand is never offered ("from your
# hand"). Bot2's Simian Spirit Guide, exiled by its own ability before IV, is in exile but not exiled with this Saga, so a
# creature card that is no artifact does not stop the life gain. The Saga is sacrificed after IV (CR 714.4).

